flowchart TD
    E["Read event"] --> P["Process event"]
    P -->|Success| C["Commit progress"]
    P -->|Temporary failure| R["Retry with bounded backoff"]
    R -->|Success| C
    R -->|Retry limit reached| D["DLQ / quarantine topic"]
    P -->|Permanent invalid data| D
    D --> A["Alert + inspect + repair/replay"]
